00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:03.080
Now, while you, internet, watch that trailer one time and then immediately went to bleach your brain,

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.620
I have watched it no less than 50 times.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:11.420
And let me tell you this, watching this thing frame-by-frame gives you some great insights into this movie.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:16.260
