Ground zero for Sonic's explosion is in MEXICO?!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.120
Ay carumba, this movie is so stupid!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.660
Anyway, location doesn't matter here.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.800
By measuring the distance between the marks on the road,

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:18.760
we can actually calculate which speed he's traveling prior to erupting into that massive explosion.

