Well, now it's finally time for that answer.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:19.395
OK, so scientific surveys have shown that most people estimate that those lines are  about 2 feet in length,

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.900
when in actuality, they're 5 times that length,

