00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:38.360
Whoa, you heard that right, over 620 sections of roadway marking specification!

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:41.200
I read some really exciting stuff for this show.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.080
Anyway, knowing that little factoid,

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.740
and now that you're slightly smarter than the rest of the population,

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:50.080
We see that Sonic is traveling 30 + 10 + 30 feet,

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.860
or 70 feet in that one frame.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.620
But considering that the video is running at 24 frames per second,

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:57.040
that's 70 feet divided by 1/24th of a second,

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:00.220
or 1,680 feet per second,

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:04.835
which translates to 1,145 miles per hour.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.260
1,842 kilometres per hour.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.980
Eat your heart out Superman,

