cause that's about as fast as a speeding bullet!

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:16.640
If you're on the Equator, planet Earth actually rotates at speeds around 1000 miles per hour,

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.400
and Sonic is cooking along faster than that.

00:07:19.405 --> 00:07:20.960
Now, that is certainly fast,

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.500
but it is nowhere near the speeds that we see him hit at the end of this 3 minute cringe fest!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.980
You see, the trailer ends with an epic scene of Sonic standing still,

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.000
while Jim Carrey,

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.960
I refuse to call a man who would allow *this*,

